<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="heading-title">我的转售价目表</view><view class="subtitle">自主定价，价格需遵守平台最低转售限制。</view><view class="card" style="margin-top:30rpx"><view class="detail-line"><text>平台下限</text><text>¥ {{pricebook.minPrice}} / 注</text></view><view class="detail-line"><text>当前版本</text><text>v{{pricebook.version}}</text></view><view class="field" style="margin-top:25rpx"><text class="field-label">商户转售价 / 元每注</text><input value="{{form.price}}" type="digit" bindinput="input" data-field="price"/></view><view class="note">仅影响后续创建的购买单，已支付订单保留价格快照。版本变化需刷新后重新确认。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="savePrice" disabled="{{busy}}">保存价格</button></view></block></view>